OL,3,GNEWSASatellite wi-fi funding for GWR
OL,4,Atrains
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government decision follows a
OL,7,Fcross-party campaign by MPs in the west
OL,8,Fand south-west of England but some MPs
OL,9,Fare calling for more clarity about what
OL,10,Fsort of service will be available.
